#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:5 2931ff66b01a48468748e71b2ed70725
msgid "Smart RTL Mode"
msgstr "Smart RTL模式"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:10 beff6019c98f4f71a16244ba8495c620
msgid ""
"When switched into Smart RTL, like regular RTL, the vehicle will attempt to "
"return home.  The \"Smart\" part of this mode is that it will retrace a safe"
" path home instead of returning directly home.  This can be useful if there "
"are obstacles between the vehicle and the home position."
msgstr ""
"切换到Smart "
"RTL时，与普通RTL一样，飞行器将尝试返回Home位置。此模式\"智能\"之处在于，它将沿安全路径原路返回，而不是直接飞回Home。这在飞行器与Home之间有障碍物时非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:13 de21ab2e5d4f403285350a10a8d6a54f
msgid ""
"The vehicle must have a good position estimate (LEDs should be green) when "
"the vehicle is armed or SmartRTL will be disabled.  If the vehicle is armed "
"without a good position estimate, \"SmartRTL deactivated: bad position\" "
"will be sent to the ground station."
msgstr ""
"解锁时飞行器必须具有良好的位置估计（LED应为绿色），否则SmartRTL将被禁用。如果解锁时没有良好的位置估计，地面站将收到\"SmartRTL "
"deactivated: bad position\"消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:15 1b74314e21b64f4598eb13ffd0345e51
msgid ""
"The path used to return home is captured in a buffer as the vehicle drives "
"around in any other mode.  The path is \"simplified\" (meaning curved paths "
"are turned into a series of straight lines) and \"pruned\" (meaning loops "
"are removed).  The buffer is of a limited size (see below) and once it is "
"full, \"SmartRTL deactivated: buffer full\" will appear on the ground "
"stations's HUD and the user will no longer be able to switch into this mode."
" The altitude at each point is also stored and used on the return."
msgstr ""
"用于返回Home的路径在飞行器以任何其他模式飞行时捕获到缓冲区中。路径经过\"简化\"（即曲线路径转换为一系列直线段）和\"剪枝\"（即去除环路）。缓冲区大小有限（见下文），一旦填满，地面站HUD上将显示\"SmartRTL"
" deactivated: buffer full\"，用户将无法再切换到该模式。每个点的高度也被存储并用于返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:17 fa5d22c1255a48748dd67d8d1e8ed7d9
msgid ""
"SmartRTL saves points at a maximum of 3 per second, but only if the vehicle "
"has moved at least :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` meters from the "
"previous point. So for example, if the vehicle was moving at 10m/s it would "
"save the points at 3.3m intervals. After 50 points are saved it goes back "
"and simplifies them into lines again using that :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY "
"<SRTL_ACCURACY>`. It will replace a string of points with just two end "
"points if all the intermediate points are no more than :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY "
"<SRTL_ACCURACY>` from the line between the end points. This is how it "
"manages to create a smart path home without flying unnecessary maneuvers."
msgstr ""
"SmartRTL 以每秒最多 3 个点的速率保存点，但仅当飞行器距上一个点至少移动了 :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY "
"<SRTL_ACCURACY>` 米时才保存。例如，如果飞行器以 10m/s 的速度飞行，则会以 3.3 米的间隔保存点。保存 50 "
"个点后，它会回头利用该 :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` "
"将这些点再次简化为线段。如果一串点中所有中间点到两端点连线的距离均不超过 :ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY "
"<SRTL_ACCURACY>`，则会将这串点替换为仅两个端点。这就是它能够生成智能返航路径而不执行多余机动的原理。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:19 b54b0f81fc0e4f1b98a203f09902546f
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways that the vehicle can mode switch into SmartRTL. "
"Either through user selected, or through failsafe selections."
msgstr "飞行器切换到SmartRTL有多种方式，包括用户选择或通过失控保护选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:21 59c8fdc4dd2d4b7e88bc64d455212761
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` and :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE "
"<FS_THR_ENABLE>` parameters set to 4 or 5 the vehicle will switch to "
"SmartRTL->RTL or SmartRTL->Land based on whether the correct conditions "
"allows the mode. The setting indicates that it will try SmartRTL first, then"
" downgrade to RTL (4) or Land (5)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` 和 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <FS_THR_ENABLE>` "
"参数设置为4或5时，飞行器将根据条件是否满足切换到SmartRTL->RTL或SmartRTL->Land。该设置表示先尝试SmartRTL，若不可用则降级为RTL（4）或Land（5）"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:23 86b2ae1339a44ee0a1b6a38ff315a17e
msgid ""
"Additional Failsafes that may be set to switch to SmartRTL are: "
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>`, :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>`, :ref:`BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT>`, and "
":ref:`BATT2_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT2_FS_CRT_ACT>`."
msgstr ""
"可设置为切换到SmartRTL的其他失控保护包括：:ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>`、:ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>`、:ref:`BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT2_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT2_FS_CRT_ACT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:26 7ca3d742ddee464dadef7f899baac974
msgid "SmartRTL Parameters"
msgstr "SmartRTL参数"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:28 6548886d3b5a496dacf7036bef1e90d2
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` can be used to set the speed (in meters/second)"
" at which the vehicle will return to home.  By default this parameter is "
"zero meaning the :ref:`WP_SPD <WP_SPD>`  parameter value will be used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` 可用于设置飞行器返回 Home 的速度（米/秒）。默认情况下此参数为零，表示使用 "
":ref:`WP_SPD <WP_SPD>` 参数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:29 d649851f4d874bd782b437ee92e92239
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL_M<RTL_ALT_FINAL_M>` if set to 0, will land at home, "
"otherwise will stop and hover above home at this altitude upon completion of"
" the return."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL_M<RTL_ALT_FINAL_M>` 若设置为 0，将在 Home 降落；否则，完成返回后将停止并在 Home"
" 上方该高度悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:30 185b3690b10448a69b7ad12447b279cf
msgid ""
":ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` controls the accuracy (in meters) of "
"the simplification and pruning performed.  The simplify algorithm will turn "
"curved paths into straight lines but the line should never be more than this"
" distance from the original path.  The pruning algorithm will cut paths that"
" come within this many meters of each other."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` "
"控制简化和剪枝操作的精度（单位：米）。简化算法将曲线路径转换为直线段，但直线与原路径的偏差不超过此距离。剪枝算法将截断彼此距离小于此值（米）的路径段。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:31 6e29671d621f42949ea9a9c847cc69db
msgid ""
":ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` controls the maximum number of points that "
"can be stored.  Each additional 100 points requires about 3k of RAM and the "
"image below shows how to check the autopilot's available memory (most "
"autopilots have enough memory for 500 points). If the maximum number of "
"points is exhausted, \"SmartRTL deactivated: buffer full\" will be sent to "
"the ground station and the user will not be able to switch into SmartRTL."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` "
"控制可存储的最大点数。每额外100个点需要约3k内存，下图显示如何检查飞控的可用内存（大多数飞控有足够内存存储500个点）。如果最大点数用尽，地面站将收到\"SmartRTL"
" deactivated: buffer full\"消息，用户将无法切换到SmartRTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:32 2cced1cfd3a343a4b54f3e9f237d35b1
msgid ""
":ref:`SRTL_OPTIONS<SRTL_OPTIONS>` has one bit, currently, bit 2, that if set"
" (value of \"4\") will ignore pilot yaw commands while in SmartRTL."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SRTL_OPTIONS<SRTL_OPTIONS>` "
"目前有一位，即第2位，若置1（值为\"4\"），将在SmartRTL模式下忽略飞手偏航指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:34 c54be8ca22874d53b823fe7e266105c8
msgid ""
"SmartRTL can be deactivated as a mode by simply setting :ref:`SRTL_POINTS "
"<SRTL_POINTS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr "只需将 :ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` 设置为\"0\"即可停用SmartRTL模式。"
